--- what must be refused rather than guessed at
both framings at once -> 400 both Content-Length and Transfer-Encoding are present
two Content-Length headers -> 400 duplicate content-length header
a transfer coding this server does not implement -> 501 unsupported Transfer-Encoding 'gzip, chunked'
a non-numeric Content-Length -> 400 malformed Content-Length '5x'
a signed Content-Length -> 400 malformed Content-Length '+5'
an empty Content-Length -> 400 empty Content-Length
a malformed chunk size -> 400 malformed chunk size
chunk data not followed by CRLF -> 400 chunk data was not followed by CRLF
a chunked body that stops mid-chunk -> 400 connection ended in the middle of a chunk
a chunk size line with no CRLF -> 400 chunk size line was not terminated
--- a Content-Length body that the client never finished
io.read(body, fixed_size=10) raised EOFError: stream ended after 3 bytes, expected 10
